---
description: Electron main preload renderer IPC and security defaults
globs: "**/electron/**/*.{ts,js,mts,mjs,cjs},**/*preload*.{ts,js}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Electron

- Never enable nodeIntegration in renderer with untrusted content; prefer contextIsolation true, sandbox true where viable, and preload scripts exposing a narrow contextBridge API.
- Keep IPC payloads typed (shared types module); validate messages like external input.
- Separate main, preload, and renderer concerns; no Node APIs directly from renderer unless architected and audited.
